{"clase": "<h4>Casos que aparecen en certámenes</h4>\n<ul><li>Restricciones con coeficientes negativos (−2x<sub>1</sub> + 3x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 0 pasa por el origen) o del tipo −x<sub>2</sub> ≤ −1 (es x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 1).</li>\n<li>Varias soluciones enteras con el mismo Z: indícalo.</li>\n<li>Ramas que llegan a un punto entero en el borde: igual se verifica que sea factible en todas las restricciones.</li></ul>", "ejemplos": [{"q": "<p>Considere el modelo de programación lineal entera:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = 2x<sub>1</sub> + 4x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;−x<sub>2</sub> ≤ −1<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;−2x<sub>1</sub> + 3x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 0<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;2x<sub>1</sub> + 3x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 15<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 0, enteros</div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Resuelva la relajación lineal mediante el método gráfico.</li><li><b>b)</b> Resuelva el problema entero mediante Branch and Bound (muestre el árbol).</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Relajación lineal (método gráfico)</h5><p>Se grafican las restricciones como igualdades, se sombrea la región factible y se evalúa Z en cada vértice:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 300\" class=\"graph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Región factible\"><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"34.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"34.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"70.8\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"70.8\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"70.8\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"107.5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"107.5\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"107.5\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"144.2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"144.2\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"144.2\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"181.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"181.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"181.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"217.8\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"217.8\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"217.8\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><line x1=\"254.5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"254.5\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"254.5\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><line x1=\"291.2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"291.2\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"291.2\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><line x1=\"328.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"328.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"328.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"229.2\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"229.2\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"233.2\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"192.5\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"192.5\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"196.5\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"155.8\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"155.8\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"159.8\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266\" class=\"axl\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"12\" class=\"axl\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"260\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">x₁</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"20\" class=\"ax\">x₂</text><polygon points=\"89.1,229.2 254.5,229.2 171.8,174.1\" class=\"reg\"/><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"229.2\" x2=\"328.0\" y2=\"229.2\" class=\"cl c0\"/><text x=\"73.3\" y=\"225.2\" class=\"clab c0\">(1)</text><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"266.0\" x2=\"233.8\" y2=\"132.8\" class=\"cl c1\"/><text x=\"97.9\" y=\"222.0\" class=\"clab c1\">(2)</text><line x1=\"109.8\" y1=\"132.8\" x2=\"309.6\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"cl c2\"/><text x=\"209.7\" y=\"192.7\" class=\"clab c2\">(3)</text><circle cx=\"107.5\" cy=\"229.2\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"144.2\" cy=\"229.2\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"144.2\" cy=\"192.5\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"181.0\" cy=\"229.2\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"181.0\" cy=\"192.5\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"217.8\" cy=\"229.2\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"254.5\" cy=\"229.2\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"171.8\" cy=\"174.1\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"254.5\" cy=\"229.2\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"89.1\" cy=\"229.2\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"171.8\" cy=\"174.1\" r=\"6\" class=\"opt\"/><text x=\"179.8\" y=\"166.1\" class=\"olab\">RL (15/4; 5/2)</text><rect x=\"176.0\" y=\"187.5\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"iopt\"/><text x=\"189.0\" y=\"206.5\" class=\"ilab\">entera (4; 2)</text></svg><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Vértice (x₁; x₂)</th><th>Z</th><th>Z (decimal)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>(3/2; 1)</th><td>7</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><th>(15/4; 5/2)</th><td>35/2</td><td>17,5</td></tr><tr><th>(6; 1)</th><td>16</td><td>16</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Óptimo de la RL: x<sub>1</sub> = 15/4 ≈ 3,75, x<sub>2</sub> = 5/2 ≈ 2,5, Z = 35/2 ≈ <b>17,5</b>. Es una <b>cota superior</b> para el problema entero.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Branch and Bound</h5><p>Se ramifica la primera variable fraccionaria (x<sub>1</sub> antes que x<sub>2</sub>), explorando primero la rama ≤. Cada nodo se resuelve gráficamente agregando su restricción.</p><div class=\"tree\"><ul><li><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P0</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 3,75<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 2,5<br>Z = 17,5<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≤ 3</div><div class=\"node inc\"><div class=\"nl\">P1</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 3<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 2<br>Z = 14<div class=\"tg\">Entera → incumbente</div></div></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≥ 4</div><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P2</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 4<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 2,333<br>Z = 17,333<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 2</div><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P21</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 4,5<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 2<br>Z = 17<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≤ 4</div><div class=\"node inc\"><div class=\"nl\">P211</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 4<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 2<br>Z = 16<div class=\"tg\">Entera → incumbente</div><div class=\"nn\">mejora la incumbente anterior (P1, Z = 14)</div></div></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≥ 5</div><div class=\"node pod\"><div class=\"nl\">P212</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 5<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 1,667<br>Z = 16,667<div class=\"tg\">Poda por cota</div><div class=\"nn\">Z = 16,667, pero como Z entero debe ser ≤ 16 ≤ incumbente 16</div></div></li></ul></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 3</div><div class=\"node nf\"><div class=\"nl\">P22</div><b>Infactible</b><div class=\"tg\">Poda: infactible</div></div></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></div><p><b>Óptimo entero:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 4, x<sub>2</sub> = 2, Z = <b>16</b> (nodo P211). Gap = 17,5 − 16 = 1,5.</p></div>", "intro": "Problema 1 de la Ayudantía 5 (2026-1). Tiene dos óptimos enteros."}, {"q": "<p>Considere el modelo de programación lineal entera:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = 6x<sub>1</sub> + 3x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;−x<sub>1</sub> ≤ 2<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3x<sub>1</sub> − 2x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 0<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3x<sub>1</sub> + 2x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 15<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 0, enteros</div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Resuelva la relajación lineal mediante el método gráfico.</li><li><b>b)</b> Resuelva el problema entero mediante Branch and Bound (muestre el árbol).</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Relajación lineal (método gráfico)</h5><p>Se grafican las restricciones como igualdades, se sombrea la región factible y se evalúa Z en cada vértice:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 300\" class=\"graph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Región factible\"><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"34.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"34.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"59.7\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"59.7\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"59.7\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"mi