2)</text><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"73.1\" x2=\"127.2\" y2=\"212.9\" class=\"cl c2\"/><text x=\"82.8\" y=\"136.2\" class=\"clab c2\">(3)</text><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"240.3\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"214.6\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"188.8\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"163.1\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"137.4\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"111.7\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"85.9\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"59.7\" cy=\"214.6\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"59.7\" cy=\"188.8\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"59.7\" cy=\"163.1\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"59.7\" cy=\"137.4\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"59.7\" cy=\"111.7\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"85.4\" cy=\"188.8\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"85.4\" cy=\"163.1\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"73.1\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"98.3\" cy=\"169.5\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"98.3\" cy=\"169.5\" r=\"6\" class=\"opt\"/><text x=\"106.3\" y=\"161.5\" class=\"olab\">RL (5/2; 15/4)</text><rect x=\"80.4\" y=\"158.1\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"iopt\"/><text x=\"93.4\" y=\"177.1\" class=\"ilab\">entera (2; 4)</text></svg><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Vértice (x₁; x₂)</th><th>Z</th><th>Z (decimal)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>(0; 0)</th><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>(0; 15/2)</th><td>45/2</td><td>22,5</td></tr><tr><th>(5/2; 15/4)</th><td>105/4</td><td>26,25</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Óptimo de la RL: x<sub>1</sub> = 5/2 ≈ 2,5, x<sub>2</sub> = 15/4 ≈ 3,75, Z = 105/4 ≈ <b>26,25</b>. Es una <b>cota superior</b> para el problema entero.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Branch and Bound</h5><p>Se ramifica la primera variable fraccionaria (x<sub>1</sub> antes que x<sub>2</sub>), explorando primero la rama ≤. Cada nodo se resuelve gráficamente agregando su restricción.</p><div class=\"tree\"><ul><li><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P0</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 2,5<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 3,75<br>Z = 26,25<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≤ 2</div><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P1</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 2<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 4,5<br>Z = 25,5<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 4</div><div class=\"node inc\"><div class=\"nl\">P11</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 2<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 4<br>Z = 24<div class=\"tg\">Entera → incumbente</div></div></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 5</div><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P12</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 1,667<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 5<br>Z = 25<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≤ 1</div><div class=\"node ent\"><div class=\"nl\">P121</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 1<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 6<br>Z = 24<div class=\"tg\">Entera (no mejora)</div><div class=\"nn\">entera pero no mejora a la incumbente</div></div></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≥ 2</div><div class=\"node nf\"><div class=\"nl\">P122</div><b>Infactible</b><div class=\"tg\">Poda: infactible</div></div></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≥ 3</div><div class=\"node nf\"><div class=\"nl\">P2</div><b>Infactible</b><div class=\"tg\">Poda: infactible</div></div></li></ul></li></ul></div><p><b>Óptimo entero:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 2, x<sub>2</sub> = 4, Z = <b>24</b> (nodo P11). Gap = 26,25 − 24 = 2,25.</p></div>", "intro": "Problema 2 de la Ayudantía 5 / Test 08 2026-1. Fíjate en la poda por cota con Z múltiplo de 3."}], "ejercicios": [{"q": "<p>Considere el modelo de programación lineal entera:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = 3x<sub>1</sub> + 5x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;2x<sub>1</sub> + 2x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 15<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;5x<sub>1</sub> + 5x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 27<br>&nbsp;&